    "content": "<style class=\"gs-marquee-css\">\n/* v7 skin: donor ribbon (research/donor-v7.html:303-307) with verified copy only —\n   297 (meals API), kcal range and daily delivery (funnel/plans), no-preservatives &\n   ISO/Halal & own Almaty production (55-quality claims from the live site).\n   Decorative: aria-hidden, track duplicated for the -50% CSS loop, motion off under\n   prefers-reduced-motion (static first copy remains visible). */\n.gs-marquee{background:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39);color:#fff;overflow:hidden;padding:16px 0;white-space:nowrap}\n.gs-marquee__track{display:inline-flex;animation:gs-scroll 22s linear infinite}\n.gs-marquee__track span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:0 22px;\n  font:800 1.125rem/1.2 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.gs-marquee__track span::after{content:\"✳\";color:var(--gs7-gold,#E0A73C);font-size:13px}\n@keyframes gs-scroll{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.gs-marquee__track{animation:none}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"gs-marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"gs-marquee__track\">\n  <span>297 блюд</span><span>1 200–2 500 ккал</span><span>Доставка каждый день</span><span>Без консервантов</span><span>ISO 22000 и Халал</span><span>Готовим в Алматы</span>\n  <span>297 блюд</span><span>1 200–2 500 ккал</span><span>Доставка каждый день</span><span>Без консервантов</span><span>ISO 22000 и Халал</span><span>Готовим в Алматы</span>\n</div></div>"
  }
